OL,3,GNEWSAPartnership running hospital
OL,4,Atrusts to dissolve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA partnership of two hospital trusts
OL,7,Fwill be dissolved, health managers have
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FThe Humber Health Partnership (HHP)
OL,11,Fbrought together the Hull University
OL,12,FTeaching Hospitals NHS Trust (HUTH) and
OL,13,Fthe Northern Lincolnshire and Goole NHS
OL,14,FFoundation Trust (NLAG) in 2023.
OL,16,FAn independent review was launched as
OL,17,Fpart of an improvement plan after the
OL,18,Fpartnership went into special measures
OL,19,Fin March. The review recommended HUTH
OL,20,Fand NLAG returned to two separate
OL,21,Forganisations.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
