OL,3,GNEWSAPartnership running hospital
OL,4,Atrusts to dissolve
OL,5,
OL,6,FHHP group chief executive Lyn Simpson
OL,7,Ftold a meeting of the board "some
OL,8,Fthings have worked well but overall the
OL,9,Fposition has deteriorated".
